<br>
<<if $forestmansionstage is 11>>
	<<link [[Climb out of bed|Forest Mansion Master Suite]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Climb out of bed|Forest Mansion Guest Suite]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Forest Mansion Sleep
<<run Save.autosave.save(null, {"saveId":$saveId, "saveName":$saveName})>>
<<if _preventUpdate is undefined>>
	<<run setSaveDetail("autosave",{"saveId":$saveId,"saveName":$saveName})>>
<</if>>
<<sleep>><<effects>>
<<if $TaylorWith is 1>>
	“Wait, you want to sleep here? Well it is past dark and we’re in the middle of the woods.” <<He>> sighs “How will I explain this to my mother, especially after the last incident.” The two of you lie in bed and try to sleep. Most of the night you’re plagued with chills before the sun comes back up. 
<<elseif $ghost is 0>>
	You rest your head on the old mansion's pillow and drift off to sleep. You don’t get a very good rest constantly interrupted by chills before waking up. You sit up and stretch before getting out of the bed.
	<br><br>
	Although, something feels... wrong. You go to rub your temple but feel nothing. You panic, pulling the cover from a mirror to find yourself changed.
	<br><br>
	Your skin is ghostly pale. Blue flaming orbs loom around you. You go to touch your face but shockingly your hand phases through into your head. You start to breath heavily, panic setting in, as your hand becomes stuck in place.
	<br><br>
	You pull and finally rip it loose as semi-solid chunks and blue fluid drip from your cheek. Your body is gone. You calm yourself before considering what to do next.
	<<set $skinColor.naturalreset to $skinColor.natural>>
	<<set $skinColor.natural to "ghostly">>
	<<set $transformationParts.ghost.eyes to "default">>
	<<set $transformationParts.ghost.hitodama to "default">>
	<<set $options.lightGlow to 1>>
	<<set $ghost to 1>>
<<else>>
	You rest your head on the old mansion's pillow and drift off to sleep. You don’t get a very good rest constantly interrupted by chills before waking up. You sit up and stretch before getting out of the bed.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $TaylorWith is 1>>
	<<link [[Agree|Forest Mansion Coffee Ending]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Disagree|Forest Mansion Goodbye]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if $forestmansionstage is 11>>
		<<link [[Next|Forest Mansion Master Suite]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Next|Forest Mansion Guest Suite]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Forest Mansion Coffee Ending
<<set $TaylorWith to 0>>
“Great! Let's go to the Ocean Breeze Cafe then.” You two make your way to the cafe and take a seat. Taylor sighs “That expedition was less exciting than I thought. So much for being haunted that place barely had anything worthwhile. Oh two coffees please.” <<He>> says to the barista. “The only part that made that trip fun was you so thanks for coming with.” <<He>> smiles. “Anyway I better get home before my mom kills me. See you soon.”
<br><br>
<<endevent>>

<<link [[Next|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 90>><</link>>

:: Forest Mansion Goodbye
<<set $TaylorWith to 0>>
“Okay I understand. Have a great day then I better get home.” <<He>> says waving as he heads inside.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>

<<link [[Next|Danube Street]]>><<pass 90>><</link>>

:: Forest Mansion Taylor Leave
<<set $TaylorWith to 0>>
“You want to leave already?” Taylor asks sadly “Okay I guess if you’re not having a good time we can.” You walk together back to the town. “If you ever want to go to another location you know where to find me.” <<He>> says as <<he>> gives you a hug and heads home.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>

<<link [[Next|Danube Street]]>><<pass 90>><</link>>

:: Forest Mansion Cellar Exorcism
You follow after Jordan down into the dark damp cellar. Liquid drips from the ceiling as Jordan reaches into <<his>> robe and removes a torch to light the room.
<br><br>
Broken bottles lie on the floor and large casks block your view. Something growls in the back of the room causing your hairs to raise.
<br><br>
Jordan steps around a cask and shines <<his>> light around. A rat skitters out of the light but there's no sign of your body.
<br><br>
Suddenly something lunges out from the shadows and attacks Jordan. <<Hes>> knocked unto his back and the torch spins away to your feet.
<br><br>
You hurredly pick it up and illuminate the scene. Within the dim torch light you find Jordan pinned under your thin body. Your cheeks sunken in and your eyes nearly black.
<br><br>
Jordan shouts something as <<he>> smashes a glass bottle on your body's forehead. Your body screams in pain as it crumples to the ground in pain.
<br><br>
"Hurry hold it down." Jordan yells as <<he>> removes the tomb from his robe and opens to a bookmark.
<br><br>
<<link [[Hold it down|Forest Mansion Exorcism]]>><</link>>

:: Forest Mansion Exorcism
You hold down the body as Jordan begins to read from the old tome. You can't understand the language but your body starts to twitch and scream in agony.
<br><br>
Black fluid poors from your body's pours and pools on the ground as it writhes under you.
<br><br>
"Hurry get back inside." Jordan yells.
<br><br>
You waste no time forcing yourself back inside your body before blacking out.
<br><br>
<<link [[Wake up (6:00)|Forest Mansion Awaken]]>><<pass 360>><<set $options.lightGlow to .1>><<set $skinColor.natural to $skinColor.naturalreset>><<set $transformationParts.ghost.eyes to "disabled">><<set $transformationParts.ghost.hitodama to "disabled">><</link>>

:: Forest Mansion Awaken
Your eyes flutter open and you sit up quickly. You find yourself sitting in a plush bed, Jordan sits in a chair beside you sleeping peacefully.
<br><br>
As you start to get up Jordan comes to and stretches, standing up. "Morning." <<He>> mutters grogily. "Seems the exorcism took a lot out of us both. I barely made it back to the temple before passing out."
<br><br>
<<He>> smiles as he helps you up. "Glad to help with your spiritual problem. Next time try not to stay in such a cursed place."
<br><br>
<<He>> walks you back into the temple's main room and bids you farewell.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Temple]]>><<set $ghost to 2>><</link>>